   "source": [
    "# 🔐 CTF Security SLM — Fine-tuning TinyLlama 1.1B\n",
    "\n",
    "**Before running:** Make sure you're using a GPU runtime!\n",
    "> Runtime → Change runtime type → T4 GPU\n",
    "\n",
    "### What this notebook does:\n",
    "1. Installs all dependencies\n",
    "2. Loads TinyLlama-1.1B base model\n",
    "3. Applies QLoRA (4-bit quantization) to fit in T4 memory\n",
    "4. Fine-tunes on your CTF/pentesting dataset\n",
    "5. Saves the model to Google Drive\n",
    "6. Runs inference so you can test it immediately\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
